{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Folded 是一款 iPhone 行李打包清單 App，適合經常出差或旅行、想省去每次重新整理行李的人。用戶只需建立一次清單，每次旅程重複使用，並在事後記錄實際用量。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-200.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>記錄用量自動調整下次份量</h2>\n<p>Folded 可為商務、海灘或滑雪等旅程建立清單，並以旅程類型與季節標籤分類，貼上備忘錄清單亦會自動分門別類。出發時從多份清單建立行程，重複項目只顯示一次，每件物品標示待打包或已打包，已打包的置於下方。旅程結束後記錄帶了多少、用了多少，下次便會建議數量並標示為建議值。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-221-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-222-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-223-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-224-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-225-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Folded: Packing List</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/folded-packing-list/id6828413806?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T22:08:11.270516+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T21:58:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:52.666595+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T22:01:36.873245+00:00","content_hash":"8e6751f6c313724dbfc38dd5573843fd1fc74d72789eb4c43a221a462411d48a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}